IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. GOOD21.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT F ASSIGN TO "f.dat".
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD F
   DATA RECORDS FR
   LABEL RECORD STANDARD.
01 FR PIC X(10).
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 T PIC 9.
01 S PIC X(5).
01 A PIC 9.
01 B PIC 9.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    EVALUATE T ALSO ( T + 96 ) * 2
    WHEN 1 ALSO 3
        DISPLAY "x"
    END-EVALUATE.
    INSPECT S TALLYING A FOR ALL "A" B FOR LEADING "AH".
    CLOSE F REEL FOR REMOVAL.
    STOP RUN.
